plier by 480% instead of 255%.\nWhen in Confession, Resonance Liberation Dawn of Enlightenment  increases DMG Multiplier by 90% and applies Spectro Frazzle to the targets with the maximum stack the targets can receive.","params":["255%","480%","90%"]},{"index":2,"name":"A Boat Adrift in Tears","description":"When in Absolution, DMG dealt by Outro Skills to targets with Spectro Frazzle is Amplified by 120%.\nWhen in Confession, Silent Prayer grants 120% more DMG Amplification for Spectro Frazzle.","params":["120%","120%","2"]},{"index":3,"name":"Daisy Wreaths and Dreams","description":"When in Absolution, the DMG Multiplier of Heavy Attack Starflash is increased by 91%.\nWhen in Confession, the DMG Multiplier of Heavy Attack Starflash is increased by 249%.","params":["91%","249%"]},{"index":4,"name":"Ringing Bells on Wings Aloft","description":"When Basic Attack, Basic Attack Chamuel's Star, Dodge Counter, or Chamuel's Star: Dodge Counter hits, the target's Spectro RES is reduced by 10% for 30s.","params":["10%","30"]},{"index":5,"name":"Prayer to the Distant Light","description":"Casting Intro Skill Golden Grace increases Phoebe's Spectro DMG Bonus by 12% for 15s.","params":["12%","15"]},{"index":6,"name":"Whispering Chirps in Silence","description":"Targets entering the Ring of Mirrors are stagnated for an additional 2s. The stagnation effect affects all targets entering the Ring of Mirrors and can be applied to 12 targets max for each Ring of Mirrors. Each target will only be affected by this effect once.\nWhen in Absolution or Confession, summoning a Ring of Mirrors with Resonance Skill increases Phoebe's ATK by 10% for 20s, and triggers an extra Heavy Attack Starflash at the Ring of Mirrors' location. This Heavy Attack Starflash does not consume Divine Voice and is not considered as casting a Heavy Attack.","params":["2","10%","20"]}],"model":"basic","provenance":{"source":"encore","sourceId":"character/1506.json","verified":true}}
